      "passage_id": 1,
      "quote": "(ii) the right to use the designation \"Official Wings of the Jacksonville Jaguars\" and such other designations as Club and Sponsor may agree to in a writing from time to time (collectively, the \"Official Designations\"), solely in connection with the Sponsor Business."
